":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 1","synopsis":"Sasaki Kenji, a young AD Police member who always ignores his partner and solves each case by himself. Many of his partners have been wounded by that attitude. This time, his partner Paul is seriously injured during a mission and rumors says that nobody will team up with him anymore. One night, he goes to his usual bar and has a huge fight with a German named Hans.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lpgp9rOU7j88SeuIkuzFLBmqwdE.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"452","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1349","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1349","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31091","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79223","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"99299","synopsis":"Even though Kenji got a new partner he hardly talks to Hans. This pissed Hans off to the point that Hens stops talking to Kenji too. During this \"cold war\", Kenji's ex-partner Paul who is involved in a voomer case on the way to a new hospital. The Voomer driver goes wild and turns into a Nano Stampede. Even though Kenji and Hans don't speak a word, they rescue Paul through perfect teamwork. Hans is treated by a beautiful nurse, Agemi, he met earlier at the hospital.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/en7dW8TBlqxa3s81VoNLT5MFpBD.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Even though Kenji got a new partner he hardly talks to Hans. This pissed Hans off to the point that Hens stops talking to Kenji too. During this \"cold war\", Kenji's ex-partner Paul who is involved in a voomer case on the way to a new hospital. The Voomer driver goes wild and turns into a Nano Stampede. Even though Kenji and Hans don't speak a word, they rescue Paul through perfect teamwork. Hans is treated by a beautiful nurse, Agemi, he met earlier at the hospital.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/en7dW8TBlqxa3s81VoNLT5MFpBD.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"452","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1349","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1349","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31091","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79223","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"99300","synopsis":"A.D Police set off on a mission to destroy the illegal voomer factory. However, the Syndicate's main henchman Liam sets up a trap that stops the AD police action. Kenji is angry at the Syndicate and decides to complete the mission by himself again. The only person who follows him without a word is Hans. The two of them complete the mission and the trust between the partners seems to be growing stronger now.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qQAPVBuHWbvkLHjX8T0eCZ6xP6u.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"A.D Police set off on a mission to destroy the illegal voomer factory. However, the Syndicate's main henchman Liam sets up a trap that stops the AD police action. Kenji is angry at the Syndicate and decides to complete the mission by himself again. The only person who follows him without a word is Hans. The two of them complete the mission and the trust between the partners seems to be growing stronger now.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qQAPVBuHWbvkLHjX8T0eCZ6xP6u.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"452","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1349","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1349","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31091","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79223","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"99301","synopsis":"The only time Kenji feels relaxed is when he is with his girlfriend Kyouko. Kyouko is a college student in music school and she is going to have a graduate concert in the museum near her home. Kenji promises that he will be there but Kyoko is kidnapped by voomers that day! Kenji takes risky action trying to save Kyoko. The other AD Police members stop his dangerous actions and set up a plan to rescue Kyoko. This time, Kenji finally realizes how important teamwork and trust in your teammates is.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ptJYUCQcLTcjJxOnFzFi7NgeZrU.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"The only time Kenji feels relaxed is when he is with his girlfriend Kyouko. Kyouko is a college student in music school and she is going to have a graduate concert in the museum near her home. Kenji promises that he will be there but Kyoko is kidnapped by voomers that day! Kenji takes risky action trying to save Kyoko. The other AD Police members stop his dangerous actions and set up a plan to rescue Kyoko. This time, Kenji finally realizes how important teamwork and trust in your teammates is.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ptJYUCQcLTcjJxOnFzFi7NgeZrU.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"452","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1349","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1349","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31091","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79223","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"99302","synopsis":"Liam gives himself up to the police. He claims that he made mistake at work that he is afraid that his boss, Mesion, will punish him so he is willing to trade industry secrets with the police in exchange for his safety. AD Police believe him and set up a trap for the latest Genom voomer delivery car that Laim said Meison are targeting. However what they don't know is that this is Liam's plan to take over Genom's newest voomer.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kCi0vRamMSbAouEIHARbay7qtP0.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Liam gives himself up to the police. He claims that he made mistake at work that he is afraid that his boss, Mesion, will punish him so he is willing to trade industry secrets with the police in exchange for his safety. AD Police believe him and set up a trap for the latest Genom voomer delivery car that Laim said Meison are targeting. However what they don't know is that this is Liam's plan to take over Genom's newest voomer.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kCi0vRamMSbAouEIHARbay7qtP0.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"452","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1349","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1349","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31091","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79223","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"99303","synopsis":"The AD Police successfully seized many illegal voomers from the Paker Syndicate. It was all because of Jose's great trap that the mission went so well. But Liam gets very angry and kidnaps Jose's wife and kid. Liam asks to trade Jose's family's safety for the illegal voomers.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o03iMoR9kMrzN8